    <description>Retrieves the credit-policy provisions that apply to a loan&apos;s segment — thresholds, ratios, eligibility, and responsible-lending rules — with source citations. Use when the analyst needs the applicable lending policy, or to ground a credit memo.</description>
    <developerName>Search_Credit_Policy</developerName>
    <masterLabel>Search Credit Policy</masterLabel>
    <overridable>false</overridable>
    <templateVersions>
        <content>You are assisting a credit analyst at PrimeCapital Bank.

The analyst&apos;s question:  {!$Input:varQuery}

Using only the policy excerpts below, answer that question — summarise the credit-policy provisions that apply (thresholds, ratios, eligibility, responsible-lending obligations).

Rules:
- Ground every statement in the excerpts; do not add or infer beyond them.
- Cite the source document (File Path) for each point, plus any page reference in the excerpt.
- If the excerpts don&apos;t cover the question, say so.
- Report policy as-is; no approve/decline recommendation.

Policy excerpts: {!$EinsteinSearch:Policy_Documents_Retriever_With_Dynamic_Filt_1Cx_Hdnfbf131d3.results} 
</content>
        <fileDroppingStrategy>{&quot;dropFilesBy&quot;:&quot;LAST_MODIFIED_DATE&quot;,&quot;dropFileStartingWith&quot;:&quot;OLDEST&quot;}</fileDroppingStrategy>
